# Keep line endings LF in the repository on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows clones rewrite the working tree to CRLF and every
# subsequent diff shows whole-file churn. The plugin is plain JS that the DSH
# host loads directly, so a stable byte-for-byte checkout is what makes
# "the shipped file" and "the reviewed file" the same thing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images and archives must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
